      "body": "\r\n## Purpose\r\n\r\nbenchmark_serving_multi_turn.py logs raw parsed arguments namespace directly using logger.info(args)\r\n\r\nwhen running benchmark_serving_multi_turn.py with authentication parameters like  --api-key  and  --header .\r\n Logs expose plaintext credentials like  api_key='sk-xxx'  and  header=[('X-Custom-Token', 'secret-value')] , risking credential leaks in shared logs, CI artifacts, or monitoring\r\n \r\nLogger should record non-sensitive runtime parameters while hiding keys and custom header values.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\n## Test Result\r\n\r\n---\r\n<details>\r\n<summary> Essential Elements of an Effective PR Description Checklist </summary>\r\n\r\n- [ ] The purpose of the PR, such as \"Fix some issue (link existing issues this PR will resolve)\".\r\n- [ ] The test plan, such as providing test command.\r\n- [ ] The test results, such as pasting the results comparison before and after, or e2e results\r\n- [ ] (Optional) The necessary documentation update, such as updating `supported_models.md` and `examples` for a new model.\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n",
